WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.650
At P′ = 1.10 the interval places the score below the cutoff.

00:00:01.650 --> 00:00:02.715
Select the destination pressure control.

00:00:02.715 --> 00:00:04.735
Raise the destination pressure.

00:00:04.735 --> 00:00:06.671
At this pressure the transported bound needs refinement.

00:00:06.671 --> 00:00:09.052
Set the eligible score cutoff to 2.

00:00:09.052 --> 00:00:10.908
The pair can now be excluded by its upper score bound.
